# Skewer Slinger (1/3) attacks and is blocked by Grizzly Bears (2/2). The trigger deals 1 damage to the Bears (the Slinger is
# the source), then combat damage adds 1 more: the Bears (2 toughness) die, which combat damage alone (1) would not do. The
# Slinger takes the Bears' 2 combat damage and survives with 3 toughness.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Skewer Slinger
Mountain x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Grizzly Bears
Forest x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Skewer Slinger.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Skewer Slinger > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Grizzly Bears > Skewer Slinger)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Damage = 1
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Grizzly Bears
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield.Skewer Slinger.Damage = 2
